                                                    <a style="position: relative;" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption="基隆市信義區議員參選人黃申棟。翻攝黃申棟臉書" href="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-03/19E1274A45B1E22AA20C229DB43CE5D8/b61fb6d874d3a822c1de80b7362de36e_1280.webp">
