                                                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/7079FCC0655EB1B37A4774C131C324CC">記者逼問「2028誰能帶國民黨重返執政」　蔣萬安：你很清楚是誰</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【記者李俊毅／台北報導】年底選戰倒數40天，台北市長蔣萬安競選團隊今（19）日公布競選總部人事，由臺中市長盧秀燕出任主任委員，並由臺北市五位立法委員擔任副主任委員，分別負責選戰統籌、執行、政策、組織及議題工作。由於兩人都被外界視為2028總統大選熱門人選，外界關注2028是否要「還盧人情」、誰能代表國民黨重返執政，對此，盧秀燕表示，家人不需要還人情，家人之間就是愛，沒有欠情可言」；蔣萬安也回應，「我知道你要問我什麼，2028一定支持國民黨最強人選」。記者追問，最強者是誰？是旁邊的盧秀燕嗎？蔣笑稱，「你很清楚是誰。」</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category politics">政治</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T15:51:00+08:00">2026/10/19 15:51</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                        <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/2C8DA4155EA5A854AD7D0B88F452A6EA">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/2C8DA4155EA5A854AD7D0B88F452A6EA/3e292568ee638e32205936a68be8746b_512.webp" alt="2萬4存款選議員！他沒房沒車沒股票　網友：打敗黃國昌子弟兵的素人" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/2C8DA4155EA5A854AD7D0B88F452A6EA">2萬4存款選議員！他沒房沒車沒股票　網友：打敗黃國昌子弟兵的素人</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【施養正／綜合報導】民眾黨新北市議員參選人陳彥廷先前在黨內初選擊敗黃國昌子弟兵周曉芸，日前公布財產申報，他名下沒有任何不動產、車輛、股票或保險，存款也只有24000元，甚至為選舉去信貸33萬元，引起網友熱議。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category politics">政治</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T15:50:00+08:00">2026/10/19 15:50</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                        <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/international/20261019/6656FFC8980881804F4B23DE5160104D">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/6656FFC8980881804F4B23DE5160104D/ef6f1d0897842fdcb1e61133ad83c1f5_512.webp" alt="回應法國暴亂近2400人被捕　馬克宏怒斥：怎能這樣對待法國？" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/international/20261019/6656FFC8980881804F4B23DE5160104D">回應法國暴亂近2400人被捕　馬克宏怒斥：怎能這樣對待法國？</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【李子凡／綜合報導】法國周末爆發全國性示威，數十萬人走上街頭，抗議生活成本上漲與校園環境惡劣，部分地區演變為嚴重暴力衝突。總統馬克宏周日發表全國談話，強調「任何理由都不能合理化暴力」，並表示地方政府未來幾天「必要時」可禁止部分集會，但未宣布進入緊急狀態或實施宵禁。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category international">國際</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T15:48:00+08:00">2026/10/19 15:48</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                        <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/local/20261019/BACBBA733CE2163A0A90EB1A8E3449C3">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/BACBBA733CE2163A0A90EB1A8E3449C3/a6a79df636fb82bb617a78e2a892c416_512.webp" alt="基隆嚴重車禍！女騎士遭捲車底　全身鮮血命危送醫" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 51 51" style="position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px; width: 40px; opacity: 0.8;">
                                    <path id="_Color" d="M25.5,51A25.5,25.5,0,1,1,51,25.5,25.529,25.529,0,0,1,25.5,51ZM15.3,22.95l10.2,10.2,10.2-10.2Z" transform="translate(0 51) rotate(-90)" fill="#fff"/>
                                    </svg>
                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/local/20261019/BACBBA733CE2163A0A90EB1A8E3449C3">基隆嚴重車禍！女騎士遭捲車底　全身鮮血命危送醫</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【記者葉先鵬／基隆報導】基隆港西街今天（19日）下午傳出一起嚴重車禍，一輛黑色小廂型車行經海港大樓附近時，突然與一輛機車發生碰撞，造成女騎士受困左前車輪下，警消將其救出時已無生命跡象，後續送往基隆醫院搶救。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category local">社會</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T15:48:00+08:00">2026/10/19 15:48</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                </div>
        </div>
